      "content": "hey i got this really bad headache starting about an hour ago. it feels way more intense than my usual migraines tho. the weird thing is my speech feels kinda thick/slurred when i try to talk and my left cheek feels like it's drooping a bit. is it possible to just have a really bad migraine aura that does this? or should i be worried?",
