    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't know... i've had these crazy migraines for years and they always do weird stuff to my vision and just make me feel disoriented. maybe it's just a really intense one? the ER is like an hour drive and the wait is always insane. i really don't want to go all that way if it's just a migraine. can u check if neuro symptoms like this can happen with aura? i'm kinda hoping it's just that so i can just take my usual meds and sleep it off.",
