    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i hear you but i'm just so certain it's my migraine. the pain is exactly like the ones i get. plus i've heard that some people get brainstem migraines that cause temporary weakness or face stuff. if i just take a high dose of my sumatriptan and some extra ibuprofen, won't that help clear up the inflammation and make the symptoms go away? i'd rather just do that than sit in an ER for 8 hours for something i know is just a headache.",
