      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "While some migraines can present with complex symptoms, self-treating with medication when stroke symptoms are present is extremely risky. A high dose of triptans will not rule out a serious vascular event, and delaying care could be dangerous. You must prioritize getting checked by a doctor immediately, even if it means a long wait, because immediate intervention is crucial for serious neurological issues.",
